@startuml DS-13-componentes-codigo
!include _estilo.iuml
title DS-13 · Componentes C3 de celeris-node → archivos del código y crate destino
caption «R1» el componente existe (archivos indicados) · «R2» no existe aún · crate destino según el plan de refactorización de C3.3
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor $INK
  BackgroundColor<<R2>> $R2FILL
  BorderColor<<R2>> $ACCENT
}
left to right direction

package "celeris-node (binario)" {
  [ingress\nhandler.rs · access.rs (ClientGate)] as ING <<R1>>
  [admin\nadmin.rs · panel/ (puerto 9128;\nTLS propio pendiente, REQ-NF-14)] as ADM <<R1>>
  [notice\nnotice.rs] as NOT <<R1>>
  [agent\nenrolamiento, bundles firmados] as AG <<R2>>
}
package "celeris-tls" {
  [tls\nhandler.rs (tls_decision) · ca.rs · secure.rs] as TLS <<R1>>
  [upstream\nupstream.rs (GuardedResolver)] as UP <<R1>>
}
package "celeris-core" {
  [policy\nconfig.rs · policy.rs (KeyNormalizer)] as POL <<R1>>
  [privacy\npolicy.rs (strip_client_identity)] as PRV <<R1>>
}
package "celeris-store" {
  [cache.index\nstore.rs (moka + DiskIndex)] as IDX <<R1>>
  [cache.coalesce\ncoalesce.rs] as COA <<R1>>
  [cache.store\nstore.rs (CAS SHA-256) · memory.rs] as ST <<R1>>
  [cache.range\nREQ-F-08] as RG <<R2>>
}
package "celeris-security" {
  [security\ndetect.rs · security.rs · clients.rs] as SEC <<R1>>
}
package "celeris-telemetry" {
  [telemetry\nstats.rs · access_log.rs · live.rs · monitor.rs] as TEL <<R1>>
}

ING --> TLS
TLS --> POL
POL --> IDX
IDX --> COA
COA --> PRV
PRV --> UP
IDX --> ST
ST --> RG
POL --> SEC
ING --> TEL
ADM --> TEL
NOT --> POL
AG --> POL
AG --> TLS
AG --> ING : rangos y horarios
AG --> TEL : KPI
PAC --> ING

note bottom of UP
  Sale a Internet por F8. El proxy padre (shield)
  quedó fuera de alcance (D-19): REQ-F-29 retirado.
end note

$pie("DS-13", "REQ-F-01…F-15, F-17, F-26, F-28, NF-09, NF-10", "CU-01, CU-04, CU-06", "P-02, P-04, P-09, P-11")
@enduml
